# 1. What does this firmware actually do?

Your Raspberry Pi 5 runs the high-level robotics software, while the Arduino Mega handles the low-level motor control.

### Complete control architecture

```text
                  RASPBERRY PI 5
                  ──────────────

                  Nav2 / Teleop
                        │
                        ▼
                     /cmd_vel
                        │
                        ▼
               diff_drive_controller
                        │
                        ▼
                  ros2_control
                        │
                        ▼
               DiffBotSystem Plugin
                        │
                        │ USB Serial
                        ▼
                  ARDUINO MEGA
                  ────────────

                  processCommand()
                        │
                        ▼
              Wheel Speed Targets
                        │
                        ▼
                  updateControl()
                        │
              ┌─────────┴─────────┐
              ▼                   ▼
        Encoder Speed        Target Speed
              │                   │
              └─────────┬─────────┘
                        ▼
                    pidOutput()
                        │
                        ▼
                    setMotor()
                        │
                        ▼
                    L293D Driver
                        │
                        ▼
                     DC Motors
                        │
                        ▼
                     Encoders
                        │
                        ▼
                  sendTelemetry()
                        │
                        ▼
                  Raspberry Pi
                        │
                        ▼
                Odometry / Nav2
```

**The most important concept:** Arduino doesn't know where the robot should go. It only knows how fast each wheel should rotate.

Nav2 decides the robot's movement. Arduino executes it.

